.TH KRGB-CLI 1 "2026-07-11" "k-rgb 0.3.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
krgb-cli \- command-line control of Alienware RGB lighting
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B krgb-cli
.I COMMAND
[\fIARGS\fR...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B krgb-cli
is a command-line tool for controlling the RGB lighting of Alienware
AW410K/AW510K keyboards and the AW-ELC case controller on Linux.
.SH KEYBOARD COMMANDS
.TP
.B krgb-cli info
Show detected keyboard model, path, and firmware version.
.TP
.B krgb-cli solid R G B
Set the whole keyboard to a solid colour using direct reports.
.TP
.B krgb-cli static R G B
Set the whole keyboard to a solid colour using the hardware static mode.
.TP
.B krgb-cli off
Turn keyboard lighting off.
.TP
.B krgb-cli spectrum
Activate the hardware rainbow-spectrum effect.
.TP
.B krgb-cli breathing R G B
Activate the hardware breathing effect.
.TP
.B krgb-cli wave R G B
Activate the hardware single-colour wave effect.
.TP
.B krgb-cli rainbow
Set a per-key static rainbow.
.TP
.B krgb-cli key LABEL R G B
Light a single key; turn all other keys off.
.TP
.B krgb-cli perkey K=R,G,B ...
Set listed keys to colours; other keys are turned off.
.TP
.B krgb-cli perkey-file FILE
Read "KEY R G B" or "KEY=#RRGGBB" lines from FILE (use - for stdin).
.SH CASE COMMANDS
.TP
.B krgb-cli case info
Show case controller path, firmware, and zone count.
.TP
.B krgb-cli case solid R G B
Set all case zones to a solid colour.
.TP
.B krgb-cli case zone N R G B
Light only zone N.
.TP
.B krgb-cli case rainbow
Set a per-zone rainbow to reveal zone layout.
.TP
.B krgb-cli case off
Turn case lighting off.
.TP
.B krgb-cli case reset
Reset the case controller.
.SH COLOUR FORMAT
Colours can be given as three decimal channel values (R G B, each 0-255),
as a single hex string (#RRGGBB), or as KEY=#RRGGBB for per-key input.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/lib/udev/rules.d/60-alienware-rgb.rules
Udev rule granting the logged-in desktop user access to the devices.
